    iast: 'tasthau kañcitsa kālaṃ ca muninā tena satkṛtaḥ |\nitaścetaśca vicarantasminmunivarāśrame ||10||\nso\'cintayattadā tatra mamatvākṛṣṭamānasaḥ |\nmatpūrvaiḥ pālitaṃ pūrvaṃ mayā hīnaṃ puraṃ hi tat ||11||\nmadbhṛtyaistairasadbhistu kimācāraiḥ pālyate |\nadbhāgyādeva taiḥ krūraiḥ sañcitaṃ koṣagaṃ dhanam ||12||\n tatrānyo\'pi samāyāto vaiśyo\'sau samādhināmakaḥ |\nputradārādibhirdhūrtaiḥ parityakto dhanādibhiḥ ||13||\ntāvubhau sahitau tatra munimāgamya taṃ dvijam |\nyathāvat paripapracchuḥ sa ca tau pratyabhāṣata ||14||',
