    translation: 'Then from the faces of Śiva, Brahmā, and Viṣṇu, and from the bodies of all the gods, issued forth immense blazing fiery energies (Tejas). That incomparable effulgence gathered into a single cosmic luminescence, blazing in all directions, and condensed into a divine woman filling the three worlds with Her radiant splendour!',
