    iast: 'ardhaniṣkrānta evāsau yudhyamāno mahāsuraḥ |\ntayā mahāsinā devyā śiraśchittvā nipātitaḥ ||39||\ntato hāhākṛtaṃ sarvaṃ daityasainyaṃ nanāśa tat |\npraharṣa ca paraṃ jagmuḥ sakalā devatāgaṇāḥ ||40||',
    conceptIds: ['mahishasura', 'sadhana-samara'],
